.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_LOMAC_GROK 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_lomac_grok
.Nd stage, label, update, and revert a
.Xr mac_lomac 4
policy
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is an
.Xr rc.subr 8
script installed as
.Pa /usr/local/etc/rc.d/mac_lomac_grok .
It does not implement a kernel policy; it loads and configures
.Xr mac_lomac 4
using base tools
.Xr setfsmac 8 ,
.Xr login.conf 5 ,
and
.Xr loader.conf 5 .
.Pp
The
.Va rcvar
.Va mac_lomac_grok_enable
defaults to
.Dq NO .
Boot
.Cm start
only
.Xr kldload 8 Ns s
the module with
.Va security.mac.lomac.enabled
set to 0.
Use
.Xr service 8
.Dq one Ns Ar command
when the rcvar is NO.
.Pp
.Nm
never runs
.Xr setfsmac 8
from
.Cm start .
Relabeling is the
.Cm label
command.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width uninstall
.It Cm install
Copy the package under
.Pa /usr/local
including this utility and its manual pages.
.It Cm snapshot
Recursive
.Xr zfs 8
.Cm snapshot Fl r
of the root pool (filesystems and zvols).
Optional
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8
if
.Ev CHECKPOINT Ns =1
or
.Va mac_lomac_grok_checkpoint Ns =YES .
.It Cm stage
Write a one-time config snapshot under
.Pa /var/db/mac_lomac_grok/PREINSTALL
then apply
.Xr login.conf 5
classes, groups, and contexts.
Does not load the module.
.It Cm update , Cm reload
Refresh
.Xr login.conf 5
.Pq including Xr cap_mkdb 1 ,
group-to-class maps, and
.Pa /etc/lomac.contexts
from
.Pa POLICY .
Does not
.Xr setfsmac 8 .
If the contexts hash changed, run
.Cm label .
.It Cm start , Cm stop , Cm status
Load or unload
.Xr mac_lomac 4 .
.Cm start
also rebuilds the login capability database and syncs
.Xr pw 8
classes.
Never enables enforcement.
.It Cm label
.Xr setfmac 8
probe, then
.Xr setfsmac 8 Fl x
with Xorg overlay, site overlay, and the official PLM spec
.Pq first match wins .
.It Cm checklabels
Read-only sentinels via
.Xr getfmac 8 .
.It Cm enforce , Cm unenforce
Set
.Va security.mac.lomac.enabled
to 1 or 0.
.It Cm test Ns Ar command
Dry-run of
.Ar command
.Pq Cm teststage , Cm testupdate , Cm testlabel , Cm teststart , Cm testenforce , Cm testunenforce , Cm testuninstall , Cm testsnapshot .
Prints
.Dq WOULD
lines and
.Xr diff 1
output for files that would change.
Makes no modifications; valid only if the system is unchanged until the real command runs.
.It Cm uninstall
Restore pre-install
.Em behavior :
disable and
.Xr kldunload 8
the module, restore files and login classes from
.Pa PREINSTALL ,
remove
.Pa /usr/local
package files including manuals.
MAC xattrs may remain; they are inert without
.Xr mac_lomac 4 .
ZFS snapshots are not destroyed.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/rc.d/mac_lomac_grok
This script.
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_lomac_grok.conf
.Xr mac_lomac_grok.conf 5
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_lomac_grok/
Contexts,
.Pa POLICY ,
README.
.It Pa /etc/lomac.contexts
Combined spec installed by
.Cm stage
or
.Cm update .
.It Pa /var/db/mac_lomac_grok/PREINSTALL
Config snapshot taken once, never overwritten.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 4 ,
.Xr mac_lomac_grok.conf 5 ,
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 7 ,
.Xr mac_lomac 4 ,
.Xr mac 4 ,
.Xr login.conf 5 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5 ,
.Xr setfsmac 8 ,
.Xr setfmac 8 ,
.Xr service 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8 ,
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8 ,
.Xr mac_grok 8
.Sh BUGS
Official and mailing-list known issues
.Pq Handbook ch.19 troubleshooting, Xr setfsmac 8 first-match, mmap revocation, USENIX trusted binaries, PR 178667, /dev PLM vs DRM
are in the package
.Pa README
section
.Dq Known issues .
